<title>UK: GECC sets 100 million rand one-year bond.</title>
<headline>GECC sets 100 million rand one-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENERAL ELECTRIC CAPITAL CORP</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN RAND  COUPON     16.0	MATURITY    12.FEB.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.77    PAY DATE    12.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.0	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/ZA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.75	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
